[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10262.07, "timestamp": "02:51:02", "text": "游戏也玩，但我好像没玩过，就像我没玩过一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10265.349, "timestamp": "02:51:05", "text": "我不太明白这个游戏是怎么玩的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10267.19, "timestamp": "02:51:07", "text": "对，就像《Among Us》一样。你只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10269.269, "timestamp": "02:51:09", "text": "完成你的任务，然后就有两个了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10271.75, "timestamp": "02:51:11", "text": "杀手之类的，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10274.309, "timestamp": "02:51:14", "text": "你知道，杀了你，然后我们再报告。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10277.349, "timestamp": "02:51:17", "text": "他们，还有，是的，就是《Among Us》"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10281.429, "timestamp": "02:51:21", "text": "额外步骤。是啊，有趣多了。漂亮的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10284.15, "timestamp": "02:51:24", "text": "我的左手设置大部分都丢失了。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10285.83, "timestamp": "02:51:25", "text": "左手设置已取消。而且我还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10287.75, "timestamp": "02:51:27", "text": "进行设置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10292.23, "timestamp": "02:51:32", "text": "另外，我喜欢Sumi的鹅在这里的样子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10295.99, "timestamp": "02:51:35", "text": "几乎是红色而不是粉色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10298.15, "timestamp": "02:51:38", "text": "所以，我们这是在搞虚假广告吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10299.91, "timestamp": "02:51:39", "text": "这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10304.15, "timestamp": "02:51:44", "text": "游戏中。是的。游戏中。哦，我们只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10308.55, "timestamp": "02:51:48", "text": "游戏内对话。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10311.59, "timestamp": "02:51:51", "text": "如何改变我的肤色？呃，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10314.15, "timestamp": "02:51:54", "text": "我想它应该就在这边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10316.469, "timestamp": "02:51:56", "text": "通过门户网站。嗯，是的。哦好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10319.67, "timestamp": "02:51:59", "text": "我暂时先把游戏里的这个声音关掉。"}]